    "chunk_text": "se deofol \u00feone Iudas l\u00e6rde, \u00fe\u00e6t he hine bel\u00e6wde. Ac \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feeah hw\u00e6\u00f0ere ge\u00f0yldelice ab\u00e6r and gemetf\u00e6stlice scirde, for\u00f0an \u00fee he \u00fe\u00e6t wiste, \u00fe\u00e6t hit Wiste he, \u00fe\u00e6t he on his sylfes gewealdum and on his godcundre mihte h\u00e6fde \u00e6ghw\u00e6\u00f0er ge \u00f0one And eall \u00fe\u00e6t yfel and ealne \u00feone ni\u00f0, \u00fee heo wi\u00f0 hine gefremedon, eall he drihten \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feurh hine sylfne Et quia a Deo exivit et ad Deum vadit, And he wiste, \u00fe\u00e6t he fram godf\u00e6der on middaneard asended So\u00f0lice \u00feeah \u00f0e he drihten us hider on middaneard eadmodlice gesohte on menniscne lichaman, And \u00feeah \u00f0e he eft of \u00f0ysum middanearde to godf\u00e6der on heofonas ferde, hw\u00e6\u00f0ere he her on worulde Surgit a cena et posuit vestimenta sua, He \u00f0a aras se h\u00e6lend, cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fea se godspellere, fram \u00feam He cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he his hr\u00e6gl asette. He m\u00e6nde, \u00fe\u00e6t he hit on anre stowe alede. Mid \u00fey he getacnode, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde his \u00feone halgan lichaman on dea\u00f0 gesettan for ealles mancynnes He hw\u00e6\u00f0ere eft \u00feone ilcan lichaman swi\u00f0e wlitigne and wundorlicne gefremede \u00feurh his \u00fea halgan Et cum accepisset linteum, praecinxit se. He \u00f0a onfeng line and hine mid begyrde, \u00fe\u00e6t is, \u00fe\u00e6t he onfeng \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6stan streng\u00f0u, mid \u00fe\u00e6re he And we eac witan, \u00fe\u00e6t",
